---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle}>
	<div class="grid place-items-center min-h-[80vh]">
		<div class="mx-auto px-4 prose text-white/60 text-center">
			<h1 class="font-[Playfair_Display]">What is this all about?</h1>
			<p class="text-justify">
				I’ve seen how easily silence becomes habit— and how fast truth
				turns to heresy. I’m not here to save the world. But I won’t
				serve the lie. This space is for the unapproved, the uninvited,
				the unafraid. For clear minds, hard speech, and work that
				doesn’t beg for permission. Liberty. Free expression. The right
				to defend your life. These aren’t privileges. They’re the
				baseline. DissidentX is my stand. Not for reach. Not for praise.
				But to speak freely—and to make space for others who still know
				how. If nothing else, let this be proof: some of us never bent
				the knee.
			</p>

			<blockquote>
				“Let the lie come into the world, let it even triumph. But not
				through me.”
			</blockquote>

			<p>― Alexander Solzhenitsyn</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
